  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt=int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    \r\n    N=3*n\r\n    \r\n    p=[0]*(N+1)\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(N):\r\n        p[i+1]=p[i]+a[i]\r\n        \r\n        \r\n    ans=0\r\n    \r\n    for k1 in range(n+1):\r\n        \r\n        lo=0\r\n        hi=n-k1\r\n        \r\n        while lo<hi:\r\n            k2=(lo+hi)//2\r\n            \r\n            \r\n            d=(a[k1+2*k2]+a[k1+2*k2+1]-3*a[N-2*k1-k2-1])\r\n            \r\n            if d>=0:\r\n                lo=k2+1\r\n                \r\n            else:\r\n                hi=k2\r\n                \r\n        k2=lo\r\n        \r\n        value=(2*p[k1]+p[k1+2*k2]+3*p[N-2*k1-k2])\r\n        ans=max(ans,value)\r\n    print(ans)    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    ",
